6:{ev:["Gabriel, the Jeroboam's mad prophet, warns Ahab against Moby Dick.","Stubb and Flask kill a right whale for superstitious luck.","The Pequod races the German ship Jungfrau and wins.","Tashtego falls into the sperm whale's severed head.","Queequeg dives in and saves him.","The Pequod sails into the calm center of the Grand Armada."],keys:["warns","superstitious","races","falls","dives","Armada"]},
7:{ev:["Pip jumps from Stubb's boat a second time and is left alone at sea.","Hours later he is rescued but has lost his mind.","Stubb tricks a French captain out of a carcass full of ambergris.","The try-works burn all night, and firelight turns the crew into demons.","Each officer reads the ship's gold doubloon in his own way.","Captain Boomer of the Samuel Enderby says he wants nothing more to do with Moby Dick."],keys:["alone","rescued","tricks","firelight","doubloon","Boomer"]},
